# The Sepolia-only secret of the end-to-end rounds (examples/e2e-keys.ts): every round key derives from it,
# and its master address holds the round's Sepolia ETH. T-480, row N137. Rafa runs, for example:
#   op run --env-file=config/secrets/e2e.refs -- node examples/e2e-keys.ts address
#   op run --env-file=config/secrets/e2e.refs -- node examples/e2e-round.ts run 12 --no-homepage
# Add --env-file=config/secrets/sepolia-rpc.refs before the -- to use a keyed RPC.
E2E_SEPOLIA_SEED=op://crow/mac-e2e-sepolia-seed/credential
